* @title Gimpel random string functions
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, Chapters 16.2, 16.5, and 16.6; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @input >>>
* BRANDON BRADLEY BRADFORD BRAVO
* ALPHA ALBERT ALICE ALTON
* BETA BRANCH BRIDGE BROOK
* END
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* A
* P
* BET
* ALPHA
* 9
* 2
* 2
* <<<
-INCLUDE "RWORD.INC"
	OUTPUT = RCHAR('BR')
	OUTPUT = RCHAR('AL')
	OUTPUT = RWORD(1)
	OUTPUT = RWORD(2)

-INCLUDE "RAMM.INC"
	OUTPUT = RAMM(10)
	OUTPUT = RAMM(10)
	OUTPUT = RAMM(10)
END
